{"id":1473,"date":"2025-12-31T16:23:51","date_gmt":"2025-12-31T10:53:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/?page_id=1473"},"modified":"2026-06-06T16:32:43","modified_gmt":"2026-06-06T11:02:43","slug":"air-valves","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/brands\/air-valves\/","title":{"rendered":"AIr Valves"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">OVERVIEW<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our <strong>Industrial Air Valves<\/strong> are engineered for reliability, precision, and durability, making them the preferred choice for fluid transport and pipeline protection worldwide. As a leading supplier, dealer, distributor, and manufacturer of high-quality air valves in India, we provide a complete range designed to meet international standards. Whether you are looking to buy air valves online or connect with trusted industrial suppliers, we ensure genuine quality, rapid delivery, and robust technical support.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our product line includes <strong>Single Orifice Air Valves, Double Orifice (Kinetic) Air Valves, Triple Function Combination Air Valves, and Vacuum Breaker Valves<\/strong>, each built to optimize pipeline efficiency. Available in materials such as <strong>Ductile Iron, Cast Iron, Stainless Steel, and Carbon Steel<\/strong>, our valves are designed for both high-pressure transmission mains and low-pressure distribution lines. We supply corrosion-resistant, heavy-duty, and leak-proof air valves that comply with <strong>AWWA, API, and ISO certifications<\/strong>, ensuring accurate dimensions and cost-effective pipeline protection.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We specialize in supplying air valves for <strong>water treatment, municipal water supply, desalination plants, irrigation systems, mining, and wastewater management<\/strong>, as well as for <strong>oil &amp; gas pipelines and HVAC cooling towers<\/strong>. This makes us a trusted partner for critical infrastructure projects requiring the best industrial air valves for surge protection and air management.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dealer, Supplier, and Exporter of Industrial Air Valves<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Products and Capabilities<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Air Management<\/strong> \u2013 We offer a wide range of air release valves, kinetic air valves, and combination air valves engineered to exhaust large volumes of air during pipe filling and admit air during drainage.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Pipeline Surge Protection<\/strong> \u2013 Built with precision, our valves prevent &#8220;water hammer&#8221; and vacuum-induced pipe collapse, ensuring the structural integrity of your piping network.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Compliance with Global Standards<\/strong> \u2013 Our valves are manufactured in accordance with <strong>AWWA C512, IS 14846, and ISO<\/strong> standards, ensuring safety and international acceptance.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Versatile Design<\/strong> \u2013 Available in various sizes (DN25 to DN600+) and pressure ratings (PN10, PN16, PN25, and beyond) to suit diverse industrial requirements.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Energy Efficiency<\/strong> \u2013 By eliminating air pockets, our valves reduce friction loss and pumping costs, leading to significant energy savings over the system\u2019s lifecycle.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quality Assurance<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Rigorous Pressure Testing<\/strong> \u2013 Every air valve undergoes stringent hydrostatic and functional testing to ensure bubble-tight sealing and reliable kinetic performance under varying flow velocities.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Advanced Coating &amp; Durability<\/strong> \u2013 Utilizing fusion-bonded epoxy (FBE) coatings and premium-grade internals (like reinforced nylon or stainless steel floats), our valves guarantee long-term corrosion resistance in harsh environments.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Innovation Through Research<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Anti-Slam Technology<\/strong> \u2013 We continuously invest in R&amp;D to develop &#8220;Anti-Slam&#8221; and &#8220;Non-Slam&#8221; air valves that manage pressure surges during rapid column separation and closure.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Smart Monitoring<\/strong> \u2013 Our latest designs allow for digital integration, providing real-time feedback on valve performance and pipeline status to prevent failures before they occur.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Eco-Friendly Designs<\/strong> \u2013 Focused on sustainability, our valves are designed for zero-leakage, ensuring that water and fluid resources are preserved without waste.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Application Industries<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Water &amp; Wastewater Treatment<\/strong> \u2013 Essential for preventing air-binding in filtration systems and protecting sewage force mains from vacuum damage.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Irrigation &amp; Agriculture<\/strong> \u2013 Ensures smooth water flow across vast distances in large-scale irrigation networks and pumping stations.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Power &amp; Desalination<\/strong> \u2013 Trusted in cooling water circuits and brine transport lines to maintain constant flow and prevent cavitation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Oil &amp; Gas Midstream<\/strong> \u2013 Used in liquid petroleum pipelines to manage air\/gas pockets, ensuring accurate metering and pump protection.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Construction &amp; HVAC<\/strong> \u2013 Vital for high-rise building water supply and large-scale chilled water systems to eliminate noise and air-related circulation issues.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>SINGLE AIR VALVE <\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">PRODUCT DESCRIPTION<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">BODY<\/td><td>IS 210 Gr FG 200<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">BALL<\/td><td>NEOPRENE COATED TIMBER<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">MFG STD<\/td><td>MANUFACTURER\u2019S STD<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">TESTING<\/td><td>MANUFACTURER\u2019S STD<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">MAX. C.W.P<\/td><td>100 Psig (7 Kg\/Cm\u00b2)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">ENDS<\/td><td>SCREWED TO BSP<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">HYD-TEST PRESSURE<\/td><td>BODY : 225 Psig (16 Kg\/Cm\u00b2)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\"><strong>SIZE RANG